# Grainline releases

The GitHub project is https://github.com/epjarv/grainline. The version lives in `src/grainline/version.py`.

When you change the app, tests, or packaging:

1. Bump `src/grainline/version.py`. Use a patch bump for fixes and a minor bump for features.
2. Run `python -m unittest discover -s tests` from the repo root.
3. Build `dist/Grainline.exe` with `scripts/build.ps1`.
4. Commit and push to `main`.
5. Publish a GitHub release tagged `v` plus the version, and attach `dist/Grainline.exe`. Pushing that tag also runs `.github/workflows/release.yml`.

Writes always go to a new G-code file. The default temperature command stays `M104`.
